{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:50 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>港島渣甸山畢拉山道一屋苑，今日（9月16日）下午3時許，一名青年男子於其中一座中層單位窗外簷篷危坐，險象環生。警方接報趕至，派出談判專家勸喻，消防亦在大廈下方部署氣墊戒備。目前男子危坐原因仍在調查。消息指，現場為公務員宿舍，青年近日受感情問題所困。</p>\n<img alt=\"消防開氣墊戒備。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21c2afb4ea91942b09cb295d611c37e5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_17_09_51_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方消防接報趕至。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b808cc0ffdc365197d58e8604fe2e36/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_17_10_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方消防接報趕至。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed45d66972415be806ae91d21a06220d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_17_10_10_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為畢拉山道一屋苑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d777b511e5689b08dff3b38f505b376/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_17_10_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子於中層單位窗外危坐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/975af32b599c949d652f468c5fc00a5f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-16_at_17_09_52.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T10:18:54.360648+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}